tegory_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"BuQGsltd3B4L_HRCP2jpTQ","review_id":"a5kIP8csLr3314E2eqrD5A","date":"2021-11-04T16:45:53","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9446445107460022,"text_excerpt":"One of our favorite restaurants in the area was jam packed wall to wall on this trip to magazine street which caused us to try out a new location. Lucky for us, not even a block up was Joey K's. We weren't planning on \"creole\" fare for this night but sometimes you have to roll with the punches and that's what we did. It worked out just fine. We decided to order mostly appetizers and share them around the table. We got an order of the Fried Green Tomatoes with Grilled Shrimp and Remoulade, Crab and Corn Beignets, The Eggplant Napoleon with Fried Shrimp and Crawfish Cream, and finished off with the Bread Pudding. The Fried Green Tomatoes were quite good. Often times when I order something l..."},{"business_id":"BuQGsltd3B4L_HRCP2jpTQ","review_id":"wXTJrlHkS-z2vlJxR8Dc1Q","date":"2020-09-09T19:39:37","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9378005266189575,"text_excerpt":"Stopped by Joey K for dinner last night and it was great. For Magazine the prices are affordable the food is down-home New Orleans cooking. I had the red beans and rice, my other friends had grilled shrimp salads and one had a reuben. The best things on the menu here are the poboys and the New Orleans classics like the Red Beans, the specials and the Italian dishes. You must order some onion rings as a appetizer, they are superb and probably the best in the city. I will be back."},{"business_id":"BuQGsltd3B4L_HRCP2jpTQ","review_id":"UiLBffTaCH2iu5X-S9bDtQ","date":"2018-01-04T00:16:39","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9331740736961365,"text_excerpt":"Joey K's is our go to spot for good home cooking. The atmosphere is very welcoming and warm, like you are actually in someone's home, and the service is very friendly. As far as food goes, we love it all. I think a can't miss is the fried catfish - if they have the fried catfish taco special definitely get this!! The breading is perfect, the fish is flaky, and the tacos come with coleslaw and buttered flour tacos. Their red beans and rice are awesome. The breaded veal cutlet is tasty, and the mashed potatoes and gravy are really good. If you want an appetizer I think the fried artichoke hearts are really delicious. Basically you can't go wrong with anything on the menu, but those are my f..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"BuQGsltd3B4L_HRCP2jpTQ","photo_id":"GMDKJq_IhuDmzQr9Fkoyew","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/GMDKJq_IhuDmzQr9Fkoyew.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9287921190261841},{"business_id":"BuQGsltd3B4L_HRCP2jpTQ","photo_id":"LH3iTCOquyg0BnD7Y_oAvQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/LH3iTCOquyg0BnD7Y_oAvQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8321467638015747},{"business_id":"BuQGsltd3B4L_HRCP2jpTQ","photo_id":"uKHc57WW1m4fj-2fJu22qA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/uKHc57WW1m4fj-2fJu22qA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8161942958831787},{"business_id":"BuQGsltd3B4L_HRCP2jpTQ","photo_id":"QtZtXh8ZYf9Pok2m9IL0VA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/QtZtXh8ZYf9Pok2m9IL0VA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8050562739372253},{"business_id":"BuQGsltd3B4L_HRCP2jpTQ","photo_id":"2YA7bO0RC9R1vRxrerDsQg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/2YA7bO0RC9R1vRxrerDsQg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7719254493713379}